{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在上半屏左侧的大号标题，白色文字与紫色强调词形成视觉入口；随后容易被下方第二块同样醒目的大字吸引。右上角目录和中间的小字不是主要入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"只抓到一个人藏着的喜欢被看出来了，具体前因和之后的关系处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"在乎被看见；空落落、害怕被嫌太黏。\",\n  \"missed\": \"反复想说又忍住、对方仍然亲近的具体情境，以及喜欢暴露之后为什么变得不知如何相处、熟悉的亲近为何像隔了一层。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块大号标题都很显眼，争夺主视线\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块标题里：第一块讲喜欢被看出来，第二块讲之后的失落和相处困境，需要拼接\",\n    \"单块标题包含多个层次，不能只靠放大的关键词直接判断完整处境\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ac1dfeb5-2e40-491e-8641-13f48107cc5c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T021103568281Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:11:48.230523+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d2621a5084c385ba67928adf733de5b4147ff8a7a0a8beb934e249c391cc6830", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools